  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis change ensures that rapids between levels and on pass restarts in 3D Pocket stop at feed height above the last cut floor instead of reaching the floor with zero margin (#3671):\n- Added `restart: bool` to `Ask` in `camcraft_motion::machining3d::descent` and `ladder.rs`:\n  - On level transitions (`restart = false`): the descent starting plane `from(lvl, a, ramp)` adds `ap.plunge_height` (the operation's feed height) to `mat_top(lvl, a)`, capped under traverse plane `lvl.tz`. Rapids stop at feed height above the prior floor; the entire descent into the next level is fed (e.g. helical feed or linear ramp).\n  - On pass restarts (`restart = true`): the descent plane stays on `a.prev_z` (`mat_top`) to prevent ramp depth inflation. Rapids stop at `rapid_z = (zf + ap.plunge_height).min(lvl.tz)` and feed down vertically before entering the ramp or helix moves (`push_helix`, `push_zig3`, and the diagonal ramp arm).\n- Regenerated example catalog case `3d/rough-finish` (`rough-finish.camproj` and `rough-finish.nc`).\n- Updated bitwise golden digest for `rotary_adaptive::offset_rings_on_the_wrap_are_the_program_they_always_were`.\n- Added pinning test `interlevel_rapid_stops_at_feed_height_above_prior_floor` in `crates/app/tests/example_catalog/case_3d_rough_finish.rs`.\n- Updated decision record `docs/decisions/3671-3d-pocket-interlevel-rapid-margin.md`.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n- `examples/catalog/3d/rough-finish/rough-finish.nc` and `.camproj`: 77 rapids stop 2 mm higher (6 inter-level entries and 71 pass restarts). 71 new vertical plunge moves feed down to the cut plane.\n- `crates/motion/tests/rotary_adaptive.rs`: `GOLDEN_RINGS` digest moves from `(2363, 10_359_925_331_182_573_356)` to `(2387, 3_362_882_240_517_259_677)` (24 additional feed-down moves) due to the same feed height clearance margin on the rotary wrap program.\n\n## Readings\n\n- `cargo xtask catalog --case 3d/rough-finish` ran cleanly and updated the project and NC program.\n- In `rough-finish.nc`, all rapid moves between levels now stop with a 2.0 mm margin above the previous cut floor.\n- All 5 test cases in `catalog_3d_rough_finish` pass.\n- All modified files remain under 400 lines (`descent.rs` is 396 lines; `ladder.rs` is 436 lines, reduced from 438 lines on main).\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `crates/app/tests/example_catalog/case_3d_rough_finish.rs`:\n  - `catalog_3d_rough_finish::interlevel_rapid_stops_at_feed_height_above_prior_floor` (pins rapid stops at feed height)\n  - `catalog_3d_rough_finish::regenerates` (pins generated NC against catalog baseline)\n  - `catalog_3d_rough_finish::rebuilds` (pins project re-generation from script)\n  - `catalog_3d_rough_finish::pocket_re_entries_never_plunge_into_uncut_stock` (keeps #3670 safety pin green)\n  - `catalog_3d_rough_finish::pocket_re_entry_keeps_the_outer_stock_clear` (keeps #3670 safety pin green)\n- `crates/motion/tests/rotary_adaptive.rs`:\n  - `rotary_adaptive::offset_rings_on_the_wrap_are_the_program_they_always_were`\n\n## What was not exercised\n\n- Full workspace test suite (targeted catalog and motion tests passed).\n\nChangelog: 3D Pocket: stop the rapid between levels at feed height above the last cut floor.\n\nFixes #3671\n",
